// Payloads the launcher embeds into its own executable as RCDATA resources.
//
// The file is generated by CMake at configure time from this template (see
// launcher/CMakeLists.txt): the payloads are build products of this build
// tree, so their paths cannot be spelled out in a checked in resource script.
// Every placeholder is replaced by the absolute path of one payload, with every
// separator doubled, because the resource compiler reads the backslash of a
// Windows path as an escape character inside a string literal.
//
// The identifiers come from launcher/EmbeddedResourceIds.h, which the resource
// script which includes this file and the code which reads the payloads back
// share. That header belongs to the launcher, whose resources are numbered
// separately from the resources of the packer. The launcher releases both
// modules into the cache directory of the sandbox at every start (see
// launcher/utils/SandboxModules.hpp).

IDR_APPBOX_SANDBOX32 RCDATA "@APPBOX_RESOURCE_SANDBOX32_RC@"
IDR_APPBOX_SANDBOX64 RCDATA "@APPBOX_RESOURCE_SANDBOX64_RC@"
